Original commit body from 6234713:

Implement cross-language linking between OpenAPI specification files
and route handlers in application code. The linker:

- Parses openapi.yaml/json and swagger.yaml/json files
- Creates openapi_operation symbols for each path/method
- Links to route handlers by path pattern matching
- Links by operationId when available (higher confidence)
- Supports parameterized paths with {param} and :param notation

Also updates spec to mark OpenAPI linker as implemented (green).
Regenerates ARCHITECTURE.md with updated linker count.
